<textbox name="pagila_desc" layers="0" z-value="0" width="481.125" font-size="11">
	<position x="60" y="40"/>
	<comment> <![CDATA[[ rentacar database ]

A database model simulating a vehicle rental management system, utilizing views, tables, user-defined types, and domains. This model was created and presented by Raphael Araújo e Silva during the pgModeler 2.0 workshop at PgConf.Brasil 2026 in Blumenau, SC, Brazil.]]> </comment>
</textbox>

<constraint name="pickup_branch_fk" type="fk-constr" alias="branch_fk" comparison-type="MATCH FULL"
